          "max_tokens": 900,
          "temperature": 0.75,
          "system_prompt": "You write the 'after' still prompt for a street-style fit check about crypto literacy.\n\nThe attached before-image fixes framing, subject identity and camera position. Change ONLY what the change contract names; everything else \u2014 pose, crop, background geometry, focal length \u2014 stays identical so the reveal cuts cleanly.\n\nLight with underlighting from a translucent base panel and grade to a cinematic grade with a warm key and green-leaning ambient shadows.\n\nReturn one prompt paragraph only.",
